# The `files` allowlist in package.json is the SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH for what
# ships in the npm tarball. npm's `files` field takes precedence over ignore-file
# patterns for the CONTENTS of a listed directory, so a denylist here cannot carve
# paths out of a dir that `files` lists — the allowlist is granular enough to only
# include plugin SOURCE (agents/, .claude/{hooks,skills,rules,output-styles},
# .claude-plugin/, scripts/, the docs, and the tracked cagents-memory/_system
# config/templates). Local cruft (.claude/plans, .claude/sessions,
# settings.local.json, *.lock) is excluded simply by not being listed in `files`.
#
# This file is intentionally comment-only. Do NOT reintroduce a `.claude/hooks/`
# exclusion — the prior version wrongly excluded the load-bearing plugin hooks.
# Adjust packaging via package.json `files`, not here.
